1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:01,930
(Được chép bởi TurboScribe. Nâng cấp lên Không giới hạn để gỡ bỏ thông báo này.) He is hungry.

2
00:00:02,430 --> 00:00:05,250
He smells something good.

3
00:00:05,810 --> 00:00:08,230
It is coming from the kitchen.

4
00:00:09,690 --> 00:00:11,690
He leaves the living room.

5
00:00:12,410 --> 00:00:14,210
He goes to the kitchen.

6
00:00:15,170 --> 00:00:17,830
He sees a plate of chicken.

7
00:00:18,710 --> 00:00:20,070
It is hot.

8
00:00:21,110 --> 00:00:23,530
He gets a fork and a knife.

9
00:00:24,090 --> 00:00:26,510
He cuts a piece of chicken.

10
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:29,910
He sticks the fork in it.

11
00:00:30,010 --> 00:00:32,210
He eats the chicken.
